@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### Create a tutor (expect 201)
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Rivera", "email": "Ana@Example.com", "subjects": ["Math", "SAT"] }

### List tutors (expect 200, paginated)
GET {{base}}/tutors?page=0&size=10

### Validation error (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "not-an-email" }

### Duplicate email (expect 409)
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Someone Else", "email": "ana@example.com", "subjects": [] }

### Get one — paste a real id from the create response
GET {{base}}/tutors/PASTE-ID-HERE

### Archive (expect 204)
DELETE {{base}}/tutors/PASTE-ID-HERE

### ===== Students =====

### Create a tutor to assign
# @name tutor
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ben Ortiz", "email": "ben@example.com", "subjects": ["Math"] }

### Create a student assigned to that tutor (expect 201)
# @name student
POST {{base}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sam Lee",
  "email": "sam@example.com",
  "grade": "7",
  "subjects": ["Math"],
  "assignedTutorId": "{{tutor.response.body.id}}",
  "parentName": "Pat Lee",
  "parentEmail": "Pat@Example.com",
  "timezone": "America/Chicago"
}

### Tutor's students (expect Sam in content)
GET {{base}}/tutors/{{tutor.response.body.id}}/students

### Get the student
GET {{base}}/students/{{student.response.body.id}}

### Update: change grade, drop parent info (PUT = full replace)
PUT {{base}}/students/{{student.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sam Lee",
  "email": "sam@example.com",
  "grade": "8",
  "subjects": ["Math", "Science"],
  "assignedTutorId": "{{tutor.response.body.id}}"
}

### Nonexistent tutor in body (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost", "email": "ghost@example.com", "assignedTutorId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000" }

### Bad timezone (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Tz Test", "email": "tz@example.com", "timezone": "America/Dalas" }

### Unknown student (expect 404)
GET {{base}}/students/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Archive the student (expect 204)
DELETE {{base}}/students/{{student.response.body.id}}

### ===== Error handling =====

### Validation: field-level errors (expect 400 with "errors" map)
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "not-an-email" }

### Malformed JSON (expect 400, not 500)
POST {{base}}/tutors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Broken",

### Bad UUID in path (expect 400)
GET {{base}}/tutors/not-a-uuid

### Unknown tutor (expect 404 Problem Details)
GET {{base}}/tutors/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Unknown route (expect 404, not 500)
GET {{base}}/nope

### Wrong method (expect 405)
PATCH {{base}}/tutors